Date: Sat, 11 Apr 2026 11:43:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] xnor-tech: Tesla legacy & MG support, external panda
 integration

- Add MG car support (carcontroller, carstate, fingerprints, safety mode)
- Add Tesla legacy support (Model S/X HW1/HW2/HW3, Model Y Juniper)
- Add tesla_legacy safety mode for older Tesla hardware
- Add Tesla Raven party DBC, updated tesla_can DBC
- Add legacy Tesla harness definitions
- Update firmware fingerprints for Tesla Model S/X/Y variants
